        "url": "https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/21068680/"
      }
    ],
    "safety": {
      "cautions": [
        "Stop if sharp pain, numbness, tingling or giving-way occurs.",
        "Check the cage is stable and the handles are secure before hanging.",
        "Shoulder or elbow pain: shorten the range and use assistance.",
        "Step or drop down with control.",
        "Muscle glow colours and activation curves are illustrative, not measured EMG."
