        "Inverted row."
      ],
      "progressions": [
        "Weighted pull-up.",
        "Pause at the top."
      ]
    },
    "muscleNotes": {
      "lats": "Latissimus dorsi pulls the arms down and back; activity was similar across pull-up and chin-up grips (Youdas 2010).",
      "biceps": "With palms facing in, brachioradialis and biceps share elbow flexion (clinical opinion)."
    }
